195
00:10:16,903 --> 00:10:17,903
Dame lo vomone.

196
00:10:17,903 --> 00:10:19,543
Va.

197
00:10:19,543 --> 00:10:22,273
Agarotece un poquito menos.

198
00:10:22,273 --> 00:10:23,563
¡Vamos!

199
00:10:23,563 --> 00:10:25,563
¡Llegó lo vomone del amor!

200
00:10:25,563 --> 00:11:10,633
Amor, soy yo.

201
00:11:10,633 --> 00:11:12,403
Estoy acá.

202
00:11:12,403 --> 00:11:13,403
¿Para vos?

203
00:11:13,403 --> 00:11:16,833
