212
00:11:31,693 --> 00:11:32,693
Ya está.

213
00:11:32,693 --> 00:11:33,693
¿Estás muy raro?

214
00:11:33,693 --> 00:11:34,693
No.

215
00:11:34,693 --> 00:11:35,693
No.

216
00:11:35,693 --> 00:11:36,693
