248
00:12:45,243 --> 00:12:46,243
Tranquilos.

249
00:12:46,243 --> 00:12:47,243
Sí.

250
00:12:47,243 --> 00:12:48,243
Permiso.

251
00:12:48,243 --> 00:12:49,883
Hablemos, Nico.

252
00:12:49,883 --> 00:12:50,883
Podrías haberme llamado.

253
00:12:50,883 --> 00:12:51,883
No va.

254
00:12:51,883 --> 00:12:52,883
No puedo creer.

255
00:12:52,883 --> 00:12:53,883
No va.

256
00:12:53,883 --> 00:12:54,883
Estás confundiendo todo.

257
00:12:54,883 --> 00:12:55,883
Mejor me quedo.

258
00:12:55,883 --> 00:12:57,423
¿Vos te vas?

259
00:12:57,423 --> 00:12:58,423
No.

260
00:12:58,423 --> 00:12:59,423
Sí, mejor andá.

261
00:12:59,423 --> 00:13:00,423
Vale.

262
00:13:00,423 --> 00:13:01,423
¿Tá tú me afuera?

263
00:13:01,423 --> 00:13:02,943
En cinco minutos se va.

264
00:13:02,943 --> 00:13:03,943
No, no, no.

265
00:13:03,943 --> 00:13:04,943
Emblemos solos.

266
00:13:04,943 --> 00:13:06,583
Es razón.

267
00:13:06,583 --> 00:13:07,583
Y entonces andá.

268
00:13:07,583 --> 00:13:08,583
Dale.

269
00:13:08,583 --> 00:13:09,583
Chao.

270
00:13:09,583 --> 00:13:18,813
¿Qué estás haciendo, familia?

