846
00:35:20,503 --> 00:35:21,503
Ajá, no.

847
00:35:21,503 --> 00:35:22,503
No pasa nada, eh, normal.

848
00:35:22,503 --> 00:35:23,503
No pasa nada.

849
00:35:23,503 --> 00:35:24,503
Sí.

850
